#Задача_implement_work_item_contract_projection<[
Базис:
  get_work_contract требует единый builder: input/output/verification из WorkItem + VERIFICATION_MATRIX + evidence-model.
Вектор:
  src/workItemContractProjection.mjs — buildWorkItemContractV1(workItem, ctx) pure, no side-effects.
  Tier: rows where workId in gateTaskIds; multiple rows → max tier A>B>C; matrixRowIds[] + matrixRowId primary.
  Non-gate tasks: verification.tier null.
  Map target_files → input; проверки + matrix command → output.evidenceRequired; codegen from trace labels.
  tests/workItemContractProjection.test.mjs — gate-task, non-gate subtask, multi-row gate fixture.
Цель:
  Любой work.id получает стабильный work-item-contract.v1 JSON без парсинга Markdown агентом.
Проверки:
  Projection tests зелёные including multi-row gateTaskIds
  Schema field names и tier rule задокументированы в ADR
Свидетельства:
  src/workItemContractProjection.mjs + tests/workItemContractProjection.test.mjs
